{"id":"my","lemma":"мы","pos":"pron","rank":11,"glosses":["we","I (only when used with с (s))"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/18/Ru-%D0%BC%D1%8B.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D1%8B.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мы можем идти?","en":"Can we go?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/396924","words":[null,{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Кому мы должны денег?","en":"Who do we owe money to?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/743842","words":[{"g":"who","l":"кто"},null,null,{"g":"money","l":"деньги"}]},{"text":"Мы хотим пойти.","en":"We want to go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926477","words":[null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Мы не такие, как вы.","en":"We're not like you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270182","words":[null,{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"how / like"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"}]},{"text":"Мы скоро уходим?","en":"Are we leaving soon?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/926486","words":[null,{"g":"soon"},{"g":"to leave","l":"уходить"}]}]}